  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Cape Cod Artist</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4421 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-art-in-the-park category-bank-shows category-plein-air category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-news tag-art-and-community tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4421\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/summer-kicks-off-with-the-guild-of-harwich-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Summer Kicks Off with the Guild of Harwich Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T09:21:05-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 9:21 am\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists is celebrating our 40th year with numerous art shows, public events and member engagements. Membership in the 80-person Guild is now open to all residents and taxpayers in Barnstable County.  For more information and membership application, visit www.guildofharwichartists.org.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4202 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-free-demonstration tag-harwich-community-center tag-larry-folding tag-watercolor-artist\" id=\"post-4202\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"804\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of a house on a hill.\" src=\"/media/archive/379ba606fbdae582f87cf1d59d143bd811645428266aa47993e8f308d9a11916.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding – Watercolor Painting Demonstration</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-04-13T15:41:11-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 13, 2019, 3:41 pm\">April 13, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists Meeting – Saturday, April 20, 2:00-4:00 pm Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich 02645 Free and Open to the Public – Refreshments will be served. <a href=\"/news/larry-folding-watercolor-painting-demonstration/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4232 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-joyce-zavorskas\" id=\"post-4232\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/joyce-gardner-zavorskas-demonstrates/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"751\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a house with chairs in front of it.\" src=\"/media/archive/0fb3dcde0373e365b4ac8b3908ebf8843a3177911afc55ea88eaa5f96fa5cfbc.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/joyce-gardner-zavorskas-demonstrates/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Joyce Gardner Zavorskas Demonstrates</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-02-16T12:39:02-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, February 16, 2019, 12:39 pm\">February 16, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guest Artist Demonstrator, Saturday, March 16, 2019, 2:00 PMHarwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich Continuing a lifelong connection to earth and ocean, Joyce Zavorskas has exhibited in London, Paris, <a href=\"/news/joyce-gardner-zavorskas-demonstrates/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4095 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-chatham tag-marion-harcourt\" id=\"post-4095\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/marion-harcourt-to-exhibit/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"282\" height=\"220\" alt=\"A painting of a man on a canoe near a bridge.\" src=\"/media/archive/229a0b15da7c594d4474f6370e3c4e139b6adccc2d5d47b47c1195328e86d705.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/marion-harcourt-to-exhibit/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Marion Harcourt to Exhibit</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-01-05T16:22:42-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, January 5, 2019, 4:22 pm\">January 5, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild Member, Marion Harcourt  is having a reception of 25 paintings, notecards, placemats, and some prints on Sunday, January 6 at 2:00 pm at the Unitarian Universalist Meetinghouse, 819 Main St., Chatham.﻿ #ArtAndCommunity #Chatham #CapeCod</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3947 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3947\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"392\" alt=\"A picture of a teepee in a frame.\" src=\"/media/archive/e2325b07094631c7cfe0ba8a3e2febc6f3657fa559d9a197eb0c5621d263b66f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist August 4</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-31T21:17:51-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 31, 2018, 9:17 pm\">July 31, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Would you like to talk art with a master artist? Join Paul Hammersten who will spend the day, Saturday, August 4 discussing such questions as: What is art? Can creating <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article cl